  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation Dialogues Europe-Africa - Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDEA project (Innovation Dialogues Europe - Africa) in Mozambique aims to support and strengthen the role of ICT/digitalisation stakeholders, precisely civil society and academia and to engage and contribute actively to multi-stakeholder dialogues for human-centred digital transformation.    The main objective is to boost inter-African and African-European multi-stakeholder dialogue and collaboration in the digital economy and society by supporting the development of joint digital innovations as a response to societal challenges that hinder an inclusive digital society.</narrative>
  </description>
